<p>Hello,</p>

<% if @position.unsigned_renewal? %>
<p>
  The renewal of your contracting position "<%= @position.title %>" for <%= @position.event.name %> has been canceled,
  so you no longer need to sign it.
  <% if @position.renewal_of.onboarded? %>
    Your current contract is unaffected and runs through <%= @position.renewal_of.end_date.to_fs(:long) %>.
  <% end %>
</p>
<% else %>
<p>
  Your contracting position "<%= @position.title %>" for <%= @position.event.name %> has been terminated early,
  and you will no longer be able to submit invoices for this position.

  <% if @position.invoices.submitted.exists? || @position.payments.pending_or_under_review.any? %>
    Any pending invoices or payments for this position may still be reviewed or processed, unless otherwise noted.
  <% end %>
</p>
<% end %>

<p>
  If you have any questions, please contact <%= @position.event.name %>.
</p>

<p>
  Sincerely,
  <br><br>
  The HCB Team
</p>

<p><i class="muted"><%= @position.event.name %> is fiscally sponsored by The Hack Foundation (d.b.a. HCB), a 501(c)(3) nonprofit (EIN: 81-2908499).</i></p>
